# Tom Klootwijk atomOS: explicit bounded periodic test program.
# With blank cells at 0 and 1, each two transitions restore tape/head/control.
# A finite validation budget returns running; the abstract two-state cycle repeats.
atomos-universal 1
states 2
alphabet 2
start 0 0
rule 0 0 1 0 R
rule 1 0 0 0 L
